Per operator: log as corroboration (not a primary ingestion -- weaker fit). RecursiveMAS is a
multi-agent LLM latent-recursion training technique for text reasoning; it corroborates (3rd datapoint
after FinAcumen + our verifier-moat) that a Critic/verifier in the loop + iterative refinement-on-
mismatch improves accuracy = our propose->verify->refactor. Does NOT transfer to the live agent
(latent collaboration bypasses text decoding, incompatible with our execution-grounded verifier;
multi-LLM infeasible on one offline 16GB P100 in the 8h budget). FLAGGED + PARKED: the
Planner->Critic->Solver decomposition idea for the HIERARCHICAL-PLANNING track (vc33/L4 wall; LeCun's
named open problem) -- a dev-side corpus-building direction, not an ARC-sprint task. No experiment
staged. Real verified arXiv ID.

